flowchart TD
    A[ESP32 Sensor Node] --> B[Collect air and device readings]
    B --> C[Send data to API]

    C --> D[API validates request]
    D --> E[Store reading in PostgreSQL]
    E --> F[Compute AQI]
    F --> G[Broadcast live update by WebSocket]

    H[User opens web app] --> I[Landing Page]
    I --> J[Admin Login]
    J --> K[Admin Pages]

    K --> L[Dashboard]
    K --> M[Sensor Nodes]
    K --> N[Transmission History]
    K --> O[Admin Reports]
    K --> P[AQI Info]

    L --> Q[Load latest reading and charts]
    L --> G
    M --> R[Load latest reading for each device]
    N --> S[Load stored transmission history]
    O --> T[Load report data]

    E --> Q
    E --> R
    E --> S
    E --> T
